/* ---- Pad-to-GPIO mapping ---- */
/*
 * Each pad with a GPIO function gets:
 *   PAD_<n>_PORT  — GPIO port base (e.g., GPIOA)
 *   PAD_<n>_PIN   — Pin number within the port
